OL,3,ARocky Horror star Tim Curry's cause of
OL,4,Adeath revealed as coronary artery
OL,5,Adisease
OL,6,
OL,7,FBritish actor Tim Curry died of
OL,8,Fcoronary artery disease, his spokesman
OL,9,Fhas confirmed to the BBC.
OL,11,FThe Rocky Horror Picture Show star died
OL,12,Fin his Los Angeles home on 25 August,
OL,13,Faged 80.
OL,15,FIn addition to the heart condition,
OL,16,FCurry had a history of stroke and
OL,17,Fkidney cancer, which were significant
OL,18,Fconditions that contributed to his
OL,19,Fdeath, his spokesman said, citing a
OL,20,Fdeath certificate filed in Los Angeles
OL,21,FCounty.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
